    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的商人",
      "text": "哇啊！什、什麼東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的旅人",
      "text": "呀！騎士先生，有流氓摸我......說，剛剛你站在我旁邊，是不是你幹的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無辜的路人",
      "text": "啊？我沒有......哎你怎麼直接動手，真不是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "安靜，請安靜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "各位請冷靜下來......不要慌亂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "趕路的工人",
      "text": "我的錢袋呢！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "都退回去！這裡的檢查還沒結束......呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "是誰扔的石頭？！",
