    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "你在這幹什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆&巡邏騎士",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "不好，他們往這邊過來了，你快躲起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你說得容易......這裡沒地方能躲啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "拉茲？你在幹什麼......你是在和什麼人說話？",
