    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "嗯？什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "你是......等等，不，您、您是？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "打擾各位了。請不要這樣緊張，我只是路過這裡的旅人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "剛剛是我在向這位先生問路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "是......這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "啊......啊，沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "......請問，您是......難道您是那位燭騎士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊，那確實是我的封號。",
