    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "燭騎士？！就是那個有名的萊塔尼亞人騎士......我還看過好幾場比賽呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "居然能在這裡見到您這樣的名人！這......這，騎士小姐，能、能請您給我簽個名嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "謝謝您的誇讚。如果我的簽名就可以的話，非常樂意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（這女人完全把其他人的注意都引走了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（到底......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（噓。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（她這是在朝我眨眼......？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這裡似乎不是交談的好地方，不介意的話，我們邊走邊說吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "正好我想要拜訪這裡的領主閣下......可以勞煩諸位帶路嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "text": "當然......當然！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（真的把人都引走了......我這是，被救了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "（空爆。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（什麼？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "（其實我過來找你，不是為了什麼別的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "（我只是想親口對你說一句......我沒有像你這樣的勇氣，但我佩服你。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "（這個小鎮太小了，這裡對你來說或許是種拘束。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "text": "（趁現在，你快走吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "哎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "麻煩了。本來還想著把該算的帳都算清了，能瀟瀟灑灑地開始新生活的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "仔細想想，這一路不是又欠了新的人情嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "算啦~在老家留幾個回想起來還不錯的兄弟，這種感覺也不差~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "還有那位燭騎士小姐，真是個怪人......不過確實幫了大忙，下次再有比賽，就押你全勝當作報答好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "......這回可真的是再會了，各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "再會了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "好了，現在該好好想想，接下來該去哪才好呢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "總之先離開卡西米爾，到外面看看吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
